[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 6305.189, "timestamp": "01:45:05", "text": "它带来的无限可能性，所有这些。 这就像一门艺术，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6307.91, "timestamp": "01:45:07", "text": "对吧？ 要想画"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6311.43, "timestamp": "01:45:11", "text": "好画，就必须不断地画、画。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6313.669, "timestamp": "01:45:13", "text": "如果你不这样做，你就会忘记"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6315.59, "timestamp": "01:45:15", "text": "一切，甚至连最基本的东西都会忘记。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6320.629, "timestamp": "01:45:20", "text": "我遇到的情况就是这样。 我什么都忘了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6322.87, "timestamp": "01:45:22", "text": "你最近过得怎么样？ 生活一切"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6325.669, "timestamp": "01:45:25", "text": "顺利。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6333.03, "timestamp": "01:45:33", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6335.669, "timestamp": "01:45:35", "text": "它们有种奇怪的填充物。 我该如何"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6343.35, "timestamp": "01:45:43", "text": "宽度？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6349.91, "timestamp": "01:45:49", "text": "20%。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6352.79, "timestamp": "01:45:52", "text": "呃，它会改变。 他们换了不同的"}]